+model cases and6 guest-inventory DATA families. Original ten Python test bodies
+remain unchanged. Nineteen original model bodies remain text-identical; the old
+late-callback-context expectation is retained in preserved v1 and replaced only
+for the explicit v2 inert-late-callback behavior. Fault families check terminal
+phase/outcome success/failure, raw/timer/error/close sink failures, no-followup
+query, one settlement/termination without firing an outer timeout, full/short/zero
+acknowledgements, invalid counts, throw-with-physical-prefix/unknown ack and
+poisoned/no-retry behavior. These are definitions, not executed or accepted tests.
+No author finding resolution, runtime grant or success is asserted. Independent
+new-source QA/security must determine whether the remediation is sufficient.
